      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="mistake-card">
      <h3>3. Overlooking the Azores Archipelago Exception</h3>
      <p>
        The Azores islands are part of Portugal but operate on AZOST (UTC+0 in summer), making them 1 hour behind mainland Portugal (WEST).
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="mistake-card">
      <h3>4. Confusing Winter WET Rules with Summer WEST Rules</h3>
      <p>
